<div id="2026-08-25-documentation-system-audit-and-improvement-plan" class="cl-entry">
<h3>2026-08-25 — Documentation system state audit &amp; improvement plan</h3>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>What.</strong> Measured the full documentation landscape on the <code>Documentation</code> branch and produced <code>.hermes/docs-improvement-plan.md</code> (state analysis + phased improvement plan). Also fixed dead <code>Documantation.pm</code> reference in <code>AI_ASSISTANT_GUIDELINES.tt</code> and created the consolidated <code>.hermes.md</code> + <code>.hermes/docs-maintenance-plan.md</code>.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Key measured findings.</strong> Two disconnected doc trees (<code>Comserv/root/Documentation/</code> = 827 files, the real rendered source; <code>Documentation/</code> = 4 dirs, only Accounting/Inventory overlap). Of 606 rendered <code>.tt</code> files: 455 have <code>META</code> (75%), 487 have <code>PageVersion</code> (80%), only 208 use <code>var(--*)</code> theming (34%) — 398 are unthemed. Zero <code>SUMMARY.md</code> stubs exist anywhere though AGENTS.md requires them (dead mechanism). 24 of 34 top-level modules have no <code>index.tt</code>. 49 stray <code>.md</code> and 62 stale <code>PycharmProjects</code> paths under the rendered tree. Changelog is healthy: 149 per-entry <code>.inc</code> fragments (it is the model to follow).</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Architecture insight.</strong> Categories are driven by <code>documentation_config.json</code> + a DB overlay, NOT the directory tree — so reorganizing folders won't change what users see; the config/overlay is authoritative.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Plan.</strong> Phase 0 docs lint; Phase 1 make one coherent system + resolve dead SUMMARY.md; Phase 2 theming sweep (highest impact); Phase 3 metadata/index backfill; Phase 4 hygiene; Phase 5 CI guard. See the plan file for the full matrix and per-phase detail.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Files.</strong> <code>.hermes/docs-improvement-plan.md</code>, <code>.hermes/docs-maintenance-plan.md</code>, <code>.hermes.md</code>, corrected <code>AI_ASSISTANT_GUIDELINES.tt</code>, and this changelog fragment.</p>
</div>
